OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIsolated mist and fog patches
OL,6,Fclear leaving a dry day with plenty of
OL,7,Fsunshine and light winds.
OL,8,
OL,9,CTonight:FClear skies and light winds
OL,10,Fovernight, with more mist and fog
OL,11,Fforming by morning in inland areas.
OL,12,FChillier than Thursday night.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FFog and low cloud clear,
OL,15,Flingering in prone spots, but another
OL,16,Fdry day with sunny spells to follow.
OL,17,FWinds remaining light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
